      "text": "EAGLE-3 Speculative Head\n\u2022 Draft K=5 -> 1 target verify\n\u2022 Speedup \u2248 (1 + K*\u03b1)/(1 + \u03b5)\n\u2022 Net loss if \u03b1<0.55 or B>=64!",
